    <string name="app_info_title">About Capture Request Injector</string>
    <string name="app_info_text">Capture Request Injector is an Xposed/LSPosed module that allows you to override camera capture request parameters on Android devices.\n\nHow to use:\n\n1. Enable the module in LSPosed for the target app\n2. Reboot your device\n3. Add a package name for the camera app you want to modify\n4. Tap on the package to edit its rules\n5. Add rules to override specific camera parameters\n\nGlobal rules apply to all camera apps, while package-specific rules override global rules for that particular app.\n\nSupported parameters include exposure time, ISO, noise reduction mode, edge enhancement mode, shading mode, and many more Camera2 capture request keys.</string>
